{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"RecurringReceipts\">Recurring Receipts</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Pending\">Pending</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Income Is Manual On Payment Payments Receipt Receipts RecurringReceipt RecurringReceipts Rent Repeat To ToDate Transaction Transactions\">Recurring receipts are automated receipt transactions that repeat on a schedule you define. This eliminates the need to manually enter regular income such as rent payments, subscription fees, or recurring service charges.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Automatic Back Create Date Manual NewReceipt On Rate Receipt RecurringReceipt To ToDate Transaction Transactions\">Each recurring receipt will automatically generate a new receipt transaction on its scheduled date. The system creates these transactions in the background, ensuring your cash flow records stay up to date without manual intervention.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Amount And BankOrCashAccount Count Create NewRecurringReceipt On Receipt RecurringReceipt To ToDate\">To create a recurring receipt, click the <strong>New Recurring Receipt</strong> button. You can set the frequency (daily, weekly, monthly, etc.), specify the amount, and choose which bank or cash account will receive the funds.</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NextIssueDate\">Next issue date</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NextIssueDate\">Next issue date</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Automatic Date Is Next On Rate Receipt To ToDate Transaction Update\">Displays the date when the system will automatically generate the next receipt transaction. This date updates automatically based on the recurring schedule you've configured.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Account\">Account</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Account\">Account</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts Bank_account BankAccount Count Is On Rate Receipt\">Shows the <em>bank account</em> or <em>cash account</em> that will receive the funds when each receipt is generated. This must match one of your configured accounts in the <strong>Bank & Cash Accounts</strong> tab.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Description\">Description</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Description\">Description</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Description From FromDate Income Is On Payment Rate Receipt Rent To ToDate\">Displays the description that will appear on each generated receipt. Use descriptive text to identify the source of income, such as \"Monthly rent from tenant\" or \"Quarterly subscription payment\".</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Amount\">Amount</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Amount\">Amount</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Amount Count Currency Is Item Line Receipt RecurringReceipt To ToDate Total\">Shows the total amount of each recurring receipt in the currency of the receiving account. If the receipt includes multiple line items, this displays their combined total.</p></div></details>",
  "key": "recurring-receipts"
}
